            "heading": "Product Description",
            "heading_not_h2": false,
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "content": "<h5>Take your swim game to the next level with the RX Elite Nearsighted Swim Goggles. Designed for men and women who demand clarity and performance, these professional-grade goggles combine innovative features with a sleek, durable design to keep you focused on every stroke.</h5><h5>Equipped with tinted, anti-fog polycarbonate lenses, the RX Elite ensures crystal-clear underwater vision while reducing glare in bright conditions. The ergonomic acetate frame and soft silicone seals provide a snug, leak-proof fit, while the adjustable strap allows for a personalized feel that stays secure, no matter how intense your swim.</h5><h5>Perfect for pool training, open water swims, or leisurely laps, the RX Elite delivers unparalleled comfort, style, and functionality.</h5>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_3VjppQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key Benefits",
            "heading_not_h2": false,
            "icon": "star",
            "content": "<ul><li><h5>Corrective Lenses: Tailored for nearsighted swimmers to ensure sharp underwater vision.</h5></li><li><h5><strong>Tinted Anti-Fog Lenses: </strong>Minimize glare and maintain clear vision throughout your swim.</h5></li><li><h5><strong>Durable Polycarbonate Lenses: </strong>Lightweight, impact-resistant, and built for long-term performance.</h5></li><li><h5><strong>Ergonomic Acetate Frame: </strong>Designed for a secure and comfortable fit.</h5></li><li><h5><strong>Leak-Proof Silicone Seals: </strong>Prevents water from entering, offering all-day comfort.</h5></li><li><h5><strong>Adjustable Strap:</strong> Provides a custom fit for men and women.</h5></li></ul><h5>Elevate your swim experience with the RX Elite Swim Goggles, the perfect companion for professionals and recreational swimmers alike!</h5>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
